{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pulls/3409","id":3373913865,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJxJfAc7JGdcJ","html_url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/3409","diff_url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/3409.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pull/3409.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/issues/3409","number":3409,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"refactor: consolidate V1/V2 packages into flat structure","user":{"login":"AlemTuzlak","id":18480956,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDgwOTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18480956?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak","html_url":"https://github.com/AlemTuzlak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlemTuzlak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nEliminates the V1/V2 package split by consolidating all packages into a single flat `packages/` directory. The `@copilotkitnext/*` scope is completely removed — V2 implementation code now lives directly inside the `@copilotkit/*` packages under their `./v2` subpath.\n\n**Before:** `packages/v1/*` (public wrappers) + `packages/v2/*` (real implementations)\n**After:** `packages/*` (unified packages with V2 code inline)\n\n### What changed\n\n- **11 commits**, **1034 files changed**, net reduction of ~2500 lines\n- All `@copilotkitnext/*` references eliminated across the entire codebase\n- All packages build, type-check, and pass tests\n\n## Detailed breakdown\n\n### 1. Workspace config (`pnpm-workspace.yaml`)\nChanged from `packages/v1/*` + `packages/v2/*` to `packages/*`.\n\n### 2. Build config packages moved\n`tsconfig`, `eslint-config-custom`, `tailwind-config` moved from `packages/v1/` to `packages/`.\n\n### 3. Shared package merge\nMerged `@copilotkitnext/shared` into `@copilotkit/shared` with deduplication:\n- Logger, finalizeRunEvents, transcription errors, constants (`DEFAULT_AGENT_ID`, `AG_UI_CHANNEL_EVENT`) all consolidated\n- Duplicate utilities removed in favor of the more complete version\n\n### 4. V2-only packages renamed\nPackages that only existed in V2 moved to flat `packages/` and renamed to `@copilotkit/*`:\n- `@copilotkitnext/core` → `@copilotkit/core`\n- `@copilotkitnext/agent` → `@copilotkit/agent`\n- `@copilotkitnext/a2ui-renderer` → `@copilotkit/a2ui-renderer`\n- `@copilotkitnext/sdk-js` → `@copilotkit/sdk-js`\n- `@copilotkitnext/demo-agents` → `@copilotkit/demo-agents`\n- `@copilotkitnext/typescript-config` → `@copilotkit/typescript-config`\n\n### 5. React absorption\nV2 react code (`@copilotkitnext/react`) absorbed into `@copilotkit/react-core` under `src/v2/`. The `./v2` subpath export now points to local code instead of re-exporting from a separate package.\n\n### 6. Runtime absorption\nV2 runtime code (`@copilotkitnext/runtime`) absorbed into `@copilotkit/runtime` under `src/v2/`. Same pattern — `./v2` subpath now resolves locally.\n\n### 7. Remaining packages moved\nAngular, sqlite-runner, web-inspector, voice, and all other V1 packages moved from `packages/v1/` to `packages/`.\n\n### 8. Global import rewrite\nAll `@copilotkitnext/*` imports replaced with `@copilotkit/*` equivalents across 222+ files.\n\n### 9. CI/CD and scripts\n- Merged `test_unit-v1.yml` + `test_unit-v2.yml` into single `test_unit.yml`\n- Updated publish workflows for flat directory structure\n- Removed split scripts (`test:classic`/`test:next`, `dev:classic`/`dev:next`)\n\n### 10. Build & test fixes\nSeveral issues discovered and fixed during verification:\n\n| Issue | Root cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----------|-----|\n| CSS build fails (`Can't resolve 'tailwindcss'`) | rolldown tried to process Tailwind v4 CSS directives | Externalized `.css` imports in tsdown config, added `tailwindcss` devDep |\n| `TS2802` Map/Set iteration | V1 tsconfig had no target (defaulted to es3) | Added `target: \"es2022\"` to runtime/shared tsconfigs |\n| `result.content` is `undefined` in tests | ES2022 class field \"define\" semantics overwrites `Object.assign` in base class | Added `useDefineForClassFields: false` to runtime tsconfig |\n| `import agui from` returns undefined | Default import on module with no default export | Changed to `import * as agui from` (8 files) |\n| `DEFAULT_AGENT_ID` missing in mock | Incomplete `vi.mock` of `@copilotkit/shared` | Used `importOriginal` to pass through real exports |\n| `rxjs` not found in tests | V2 test utilities use rxjs, not in react-core deps | Added `rxjs` as devDependency |\n| Wrong `package.json` import path | `../../../../package.json` resolved to wrong package after move | Fixed to `../../../package.json` |\n| Cross-package test import broken | Relative path `../../../../core/` wrong after directory restructure | Updated to correct depth |\n\n## What stays the same\n\n- **Public API**: All `@copilotkit/*` package names and their `./v2` subpath exports remain identical\n- **Package.json exports**: No changes to the exports map consumers depend on\n- **Runtime behavior**: No functional changes — only structural reorganization\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] All `@copilotkit/*` packages build successfully (`nx run-many -t build`)\n- [x] All tests pass (runtime: 376/376, react-core: 858/858, all others green)\n- [x] Type checking passes for shared, demo-agents, and all non-pre-existing failures\n- [x] No remaining `@copilotkitnext` references in source\n- [ ] CI pipeline runs clean\n- [ ] Verify examples still work end-to-end","created_at":"2026-03-09T15:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T04:55:56Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"jpr5","id":86957,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5","html_url":"https://github.com/jpr5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpr5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pulls/3409/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pulls/3409/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/issues/3409/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/statuses/ad8a379f1fcedfe637a6fe41ed762d101590b4d6","head":{"label":"CopilotKit:refactor/package-consolidation","ref":"refactor/package-consolidation","sha":"ad8a379f1fcedfe637a6fe41ed762d101590b4d6","user":{"login":"CopilotKit","id":131273140,"node_id":"O_kgDOB9MRtA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1312